sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as React Client
    participant Srv as Express App
    participant Rt as Route Handler
    participant Ctrl as Controller
    participant Mod as Mongoose Model
    participant DB as MongoDB

    Client->>Srv: HTTP XHR (JSON + Bearer JWT)
    Srv->>Srv: CORS guard, helmet, compression, logging
    Srv->>Rt: matched route (e.g. PUT /api/pets/:id)
    Rt->>Rt: protect: verify JWT, load user, block check
    Rt->>Rt: adminOnly (for role-protected routes)
    Rt->>Ctrl: call controller (ownership known on req.user)
    Ctrl->>Mod: find({ owner: req.user.id, _id }) or create/update
    Mod->>DB: query / persist
    DB-->>Mod: document(s)
    Mod-->>Ctrl: result (with populate)
    Ctrl-->>Rt: res.json(success, data)
    Rt-->>Srv: response escapes
    Srv-->>Client: HTTP 2xx JSON
    Note over Srv,Client: On error path, central error handler returns 4xx/5xx JSON